Hospital kitchens do not get a moral pass on pests because the building is large. If you build a warm, wet, low-airflow room around an industrial dish machine, you have designed roach habitat. If you park a recycling bin in a wet zone and let food waste ride in it, you have designed fruit fly nursery.

At St. Francis I treated pests as **ecology problems**, not as “call the guy with the sprayer again.” The hospital’s pest control contractor had not cleared infestations that were rooted in engineering and behavior @cite[key="ois-pest"].

## The dish-room engineering flaw

There is no meaningful airflow in the dish room. The machine produces steam, standing water, and heat — a permanent microclimate on the ceiling and in voids @cite[key="wp-st-francis-story"].

Spraying without changing that climate is triage on a flooded basement. Deep cleaning and power-washing bought headroom @cite[key="st-francis-deep-clean"], but the structural diagnosis was airflow and moisture control. Notes in the Drive corpus also explore sound and vibration issues in the same room (Helmholtz / Acoustiblok ideas) @cite[key="sop-acoustics"] — adjacent to “why this room feels cursed” even if acoustics are not pests.

## Roaches

Roach materials and response steps are documented in the indexed SOP set @cite[key="sop-roach-materials"]. Publicly, the story is simpler: once habitat shrank and surfaces were actually clean, contractor visits started matching reality instead of fighting a grease waterfall.

## Fruit flies

Fruit flies traced to employee behaviors: trash routed into recycling, and a recycling bin positioned in a wet location that kept organic residue fermenting @cite[key="wp-st-francis-story"].

Fixing flies was partly education, partly moving the bin, partly enforcing separation so recycling was not a stealth compost heap.

## Inspection narrative

Improved pest outcomes fed the same inspection story as the deep-clean campaign — management could demonstrate an improvement mindset to hospital leadership @cite[key="wp-st-francis-story"].

